WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:06.167
P4.0 · One forecast: GL to cash, then budget to cash

2
00:00:07.317 --> 00:00:14.172
Up to the latest closing, the ledger as booked. Then its open balances turn into cash through the flow rules.

3
00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:18.803
After the cutoff, the flagged budget takes over, through its own cash rules.

4
00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:26.673
The cutoff is the handoff: by default three months after the latest closing, December for a September close.

5
00:00:26.723 --> 00:00:29.782
Drag it on the cash flows chart to move the handoff.

6
00:00:30.932 --> 00:00:34.295
Each month you import the ledger, a new closing appears.

7
00:00:34.345 --> 00:00:39.435
Nobody re-keys the forecast: it is rebuilt from the latest closing every time.

8
00:00:41.232 --> 00:00:46.312
Next: P4.1  Budgets: drivers, import, conversion to cash

